sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Customer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>DesignerAvailabilityPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ViewDesignerAvailabilityBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ViewDesignerAvailabilityController
  participant Availability as «entity»<br/>Availability
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: view a designer's availability calendar
  UI->>B: GET /api/customer/designers/{id}/availability (JWT)
  B->>C: view(Integer designerId, YearMonth month)
  C->>Availability: monthFor()
  Availability->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Availability: rows
  Availability-->>C: result
  C-->>B: AvailabilityMonth
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result